            <keyword>MAVEN SWIA Calibrated Data</keyword>
            <description>
               This bundle contains fully calibrated MAVEN SWIA data, including ion velocity distributions, 
               energy spectra, and density, temperature, and velocity moments from onboard calculations. 
               Tables of sensitivity and energy/angle maps are included in files.
            </description>
